<title>SPAIN: IBCA affirms Santander long, short ratings.</title>
<headline>IBCA affirms Santander long, short ratings.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>European credit rating agency IBCA said on Friday it affirmed the ratings for Spain's Banco Santander at AA minus long-term and A1+ short-term.</p>
</text>
